      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-gray font-light text-sm">
        <li>HTML5</li>
        <li>WAI-ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications)</li>
        <li>CSS3 / Tailwind CSS</li>
        <li>Modern JavaScript (ECMAScript 2020+)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

